; error: 8:16: this task value goes where a lambda that keeps what it uses is expected, [@r](int) -> int, and keeps itself in a region, which no other value of this call names; give a task by its name, or keep this one first, as in 'fixed kept: [@r](int) -> int = …'
; A task value kept where a lambda that keeps what it uses is expected needs a region.
task apply(f: [@r](int) -> int, x: int) -> int
    <- f(x)
fi
task main()
    fixed plain = (x: int) -> int <- x - 1 fi
    show(apply(plain, 10))
fi
